msgid "We can realize the time-evolution operator generated by a given Hamiltonian: $U=e^{-iHt}$ via the [Lie-Trotter approximation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter).\n"
msgstr "Putem realiza operatorul de evoluție temporală generat de un Hamiltonian dat: $U=e^{-iHt}$ prin [aproximarea Lie-Trotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
